{"surah":14,"ayahs":["ا<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_necessary\">لٓ</span>ر‌ۚ كِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">تَٰ</span>بٌ أَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">نزَ</span>لْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">نَٰ</span>هُ إِلَيْكَ لِتُخْرِجَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>اسَ مِنَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>ظُّلُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">مَٰ</span>تِ إِلَى <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نُّ</span>ورِ بِإِذْنِ رَبِّهِمْ إِلَىٰ صِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">رَٰ</span>طِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَزِيزِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">مِي</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دِ</span>","ٱللَّهِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِى لَهُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> مَا فِى <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">مَٰوَٰ</span>تِ وَمَا فِى <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِ‌ۗ وَوَيْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">لٌ لِّ</span>لْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">كَٰ</span>فِرِينَ مِنْ عَذَا<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">بٍ شَ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">دِي</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دٍ</span>","ٱلَّذِينَ يَسْتَحِبُّونَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَيَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">وٰ</span>ةَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>دُّنْ